    <!-- [Page One]\n\nWelcome to Courier Diary.\n\nThis diary records the experiences of a low-level courier during his time working for the mega corporation. It contains practical advice and survival lessons. -->
    <Mugirl.CourierDiary.Page1>【第一页】\n\n欢迎阅读《运货员日记》！\n\n这本日记记录了一个底层运货员在巨型企业工作期间的种种经历，包含大量实用技巧和生存经验。</Mugirl.CourierDiary.Page1>
    <!-- [Page Two]\n\nAbout the mega corporation:\n\nThe mega corporation is a vast corporate alliance with armed forces spread across many planets. They field distinctive OPIC and PMC weapon series.\n\nWhen facing a raid, pay attention to enemy equipment tiers. Enemies carrying PMC-prefix weapons are usually more dangerous. -->
    <Mugirl.CourierDiary.Page2>【第二页】\n\n关于巨型企业：\n\n巨型企业是一个庞大的企业联合体，其武装力量遍布各个星球。他们拥有独特的OPIC和PMC系列的武器装备。\n\n遭遇袭击时请注意敌人的装备等级——携带PMC前缀武器的敌人往往更危险。</Mugirl.CourierDiary.Page2>
    <!-- [Page Three]\n\nAbout Mugirls:\n\nMugirls are products of genetic engineering. Their milk has exceptional nutritional value, and Mugirl dairy products can provide additional benefits.\n\nMugirl milk pudding improves mood, cheese can detoxify, and aged cheese and milk tablets can strengthen immunity. -->
    <Mugirl.CourierDiary.Page3>【第三页】\n\n关于雪牛娘：\n\n雪牛娘是基因工程的产物，她们分泌的乳汁具有非凡的营养价值。可以通过制作各种雪牛娘奶制品来获得额外加成。\n\n雪牛娘奶布丁能提升心情，奶酪可以解毒，陈年奶酪和奶片能增强免疫力。</Mugirl.CourierDiary.Page3>
    <!-- [Page Four]\n\nAbout restraint keys:\n\nCrude restraint keys can be made at machining tables or smithies. Fine restraint keys require more advanced workstations.\n\nIf you find keys carried by a lucky courier, you can use them to unlock restraints on Mugirls. -->
    <Mugirl.CourierDiary.Page4>【第四页】\n\n关于束具钥匙：\n\n粗糙束具钥匙可以在机械加工台或锻造台制作，精致束具钥匙需要更高级的工作台。\n\n如果你捡到了运气好的运货员携带的钥匙，可以用它们来解开雪牛娘身上的束具。</Mugirl.CourierDiary.Page4>
    <!-- [Page Five]\n\nSurvival advice:\n\n1. Develop Mugirl husbandry for a stable milk supply\n2. Build enough defenses against mega corporation raids\n3. Produce dairy foods to strengthen colonists\n4. Restraint keys can help recruit enslaved Mugirls\n\nGood luck surviving this brutal world. -->
    <Mugirl.CourierDiary.Page5>【第五页】\n\n生存建议：\n\n1. 发展雪牛娘养殖以获得稳定的奶源\n2. 积攒足够的防御力量应对巨型企业袭击\n3. 制作各种奶制品以增强殖民者的能力\n4. 束具钥匙可以用来招募雪牛娘奴隶\n\n祝你在这个残酷的世界中活下来！</Mugirl.CourierDiary.Page5>
    <!-- Wanderer Joins: {PAWN_nameDef} -->
    <Mugirl.LetterLabelWandererJoins>流浪者加入：{PAWN_nameDef}</Mugirl.LetterLabelWandererJoins>
    <!-- A {PAWN_title} named {PAWN_nameDef} has arrived here, wishing to join the colony.\n\n[PAWN_pronoun] claims to have nowhere else to go and is willing to contribute. {PAWN_objective} won't leave voluntarily; you can choose to refuse {PAWN_objective} and send {PAWN_objective} away. However, your colonists will feel uneasy about turning away someone in need. -->
    <Mugirl.LetterWandererJoins>一位名叫{PAWN_nameDef}的{PAWN_title}来到这里，想要加入殖民地。\n\n[PAWN_pronoun]声称没有地方可去，并且愿意做出贡献。{PAWN_objective}不会主动离开，你可以选择拒绝{PAWN_objective}，把{PAWN_objective}送走。然而，你的殖民者们会对送走一个需要帮助的人而感到不安。</Mugirl.LetterWandererJoins>
    <!-- Transport Pod Crashed (Mugirl Slave) -->
    <Mugirl.LetterLabelOpeningPodCrash>逃生舱坠毁（雪牛娘奴隶）</Mugirl.LetterLabelOpeningPodCrash>
    <!-- Transport pods have crashed, carrying multiple escapees. -->
    <Mugirl.OpeningPodCrash_MultipleIntro>逃生舱坠毁，里面载有多位逃亡者。</Mugirl.OpeningPodCrash_MultipleIntro>
    <!-- Two transport pods have crash-landed nearby, each carrying an escaped Mugirl slave.\nThey just escaped from a mega corporation's slave transport ship- whether due to ship malfunction, attack, or some other means remains unknown. The escape has left them utterly exhausted, and the tightly bound slave restraints on their bodies silently record the pain and submission they endured under the mega corporation's tyranny. The impact has also left both of them severely injured.\n\nNow they have nowhere to go. If you choose to rescue them, they will join your colony. Will you give these two pitiful yet lovely escapees a chance at freedom and a new life? -->
    <Mugirl.OpeningPodCrash>两个逃生舱在附近坠毁，每个逃生舱里面载有一名逃脱的雪牛娘奴隶。\n她俩刚刚从巨型企业的奴隶运输船中逃脱，究竟是飞船故障、遭遇攻击，还是她们以其他方式逃脱尚不得而知。逃亡的经历令她俩精疲力尽，紧密捆缚在她们身上的奴隶束具，无声记录着她们在巨型企业暴政下的痛苦与屈从。撞击也让她俩受了重伤。\n\n如今她俩无处可去，如果你选择营救她俩，她俩会加入你的殖民地，你愿意给这两位可爱又可怜的逃亡者一次自由与新生活的机会吗？</Mugirl.OpeningPodCrash>
    <!-- Among them, {PAWN_nameDef} is a {AGE}-year-old child who has just escaped from a slave caravan and is completely alone. -->
    <Mugirl.OpeningPodCrash_Child>其中{PAWN_nameDef}是个{AGE}岁的孩子，她刚刚逃离了奴隶商队的控制，孤身无依。</Mugirl.OpeningPodCrash_Child>
    <!-- Among them, [PAWN_pronoun] doesn't belong to any faction. You can choose to rescue [PAWN_objective], hoping [PAWN_pronoun] will freely join your colony, or you can choose to capture [PAWN_objective] to recruit or enslave [PAWN_objective]. -->
    <Mugirl.OpeningPodCrash_Factionless>其中{PAWN_pronoun}不属于任何派系。你可以选择救援{PAWN_objective}，希望{PAWN_pronoun}自由加入你的殖民地，也可以选择俘虏{PAWN_objective}以招募或奴役她。</Mugirl.OpeningPodCrash_Factionless>
    <!-- Neither belongs to any faction. You can choose to rescue them, hoping they will freely join your colony, or you can choose to capture them to recruit or enslave them. -->
    <Mugirl.OpeningPodCrash_FactionlessMultiple>她俩都不属于任何派系。你可以选择救援她俩，希望她们自由加入你的殖民地，也可以选择俘虏她们以招募或奴役。</Mugirl.OpeningPodCrash_FactionlessMultiple>
    <!-- Among them, {PAWN_nameDef} comes from the hostile faction {PAWN_factionName}. You can capture [PAWN_objective] to recruit or enslave [PAWN_objective]. -->
